Global notes:
Note (G1): BASS DR2 numbers from the BAT 70-month survey catalog identifiers
    (Baumgartner+, 2013, J/ApJS/207/19 - <SWIFT JHHMM+DDMMA> in Simbad;
    see http://swift.gsfc.nasa.gov/results/bs70mon/). 
    Note that, the components ("B") are not part of 
    Baumgartner+, 2013, J/ApJS/207/19 ("A" components have been added 
    by CDS to match the other BASS papers).
